00:05:38,823 --> 00:05:44,823
The most important part of a story is the ending.

2
00:11:17,647 --> 00:11:23,647
Secret Window is a mystery, thriller film directed by David Koepp.

3
00:16:56,470 --> 00:17:02,470
Mort Rainey, a writer just emerging from a painful divorce with his ex-wife, is stalked at his remote lake
house by a psychotic stranger and would-be scribe who claims Rainey swiped his best story idea.

4
00:22:35,294 --> 00:22:41,294
But as Rainey endeavors to prove his innocence, he
begins to question his own sanity.

5
00:28:14,117 --> 00:28:20,117
Mort Rainey, played by Johnny Depp.

6
00:33:52,941 --> 00:33:58,941
John Shooter, played by John Turturro.

7
00:39:31,764 --> 00:39:37,764
Amy Rainey, played by Maria Bello.

8
00:45:10,588 --> 00:45:16,588
