Ken Karsch, played by Charles S. Dutton.

10
00:56:28,235 --> 00:56:34,235
Sheriff Dave Newsome, played by Len Cariou.

11
01:02:07,058 --> 01:02:13,058
Secret Window is a 2004 American thriller film
starring Johnny Depp and John Turturro.

12
01:07:45,882 --> 01:07:51,882
It was written and directed by David Koepp, based on the novella Secret Window, Secret Garden
by Stephen King, featuring a musical score by Philip Glass and Geoff Zanelli.

13
01:13:24,705 --> 01:13:30,705
The story appeared in King's 1990 collection Four Past Midnight and follows a struggling writer who is terrorized by an
elusive adversary while dealing with an ongoing divorce from his estranged wife and tolerating her new husband.

14
01:19:03,529 --> 01:19:09,529
The film was released on March 12, 2004, by Columbia Pictures; it was a
moderate box office success and received mixed reviews from critics.

15
01:24:42,352 --> 01:24:48,352
The film explores themes of adultery, jealousy, nightmare, police, isolation.

16
01:30:21,176 --> 01:30:27,176
The tone is intense and mind_bending.
